    - Term: 'item.clothing_shorts_summer.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Denim Shorts'
      - 'Джинсовые шорты'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_shorts_summer.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Cut short and worn thin. Nothing between her legs and the weather.'
      - 'Короткие и вытертые. Между ногами и погодой ничего.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_tshirt_summer.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'T-Shirt'
      - 'Футболка'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_tshirt_summer.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Plain cotton, short sleeves. What she reaches for first.'
      - 'Простой хлопок, короткий рукав. То, за чем тянется первым делом.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_tanktop_summer.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Tank Top'
      - 'Майка'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_tanktop_summer.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
