      - 'Street Shirt (07)'
      - 'Уличная рубашка (07)'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_shirt_amy_07.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Loose, long-sleeved, worn open. Covers the arms and little else.'
      - 'Свободная, с длинным рукавом, нараспашку. Закрывает руки, и только.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_shirt_amy_08.name'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Street Shirt (08)'
      - 'Уличная рубашка (08)'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_shirt_amy_08.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Loose, long-sleeved, worn open. Covers the arms and little else.'
