      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Blouse Tied at the Waist (Denim)'
      - 'Блузка на поясе (Denim)'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_blouse_waist_riot_denim.desc'
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Sleeves knotted at the hip. Not worn so much as carried.'
      - 'Рукава завязаны на бедре. Скорее носится с собой, чем надета.'
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: 'item.clothing_blouse_waist_riot_green.name'
